#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DATE"
msgstr "DATE"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux
#, no-wrap
msgid "August 2024"
msgstr "2024년 8월"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "GNU coreutils 9.5"
msgstr "GNU coreutils 9.5"

#. type: TH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Commands"
msgstr "사용자 명령"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "이름"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "date - print or set the system date and time"
msgstr "date - 시스템 시간과 날짜를 출력/설정한다."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "요약"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<date> [I<\\,OPTION\\/>]... [I<\\,+FORMAT\\/>]"
msgstr "B<date> [I<\\,옵션\\/>]... [I<\\,+형식\\/>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<date> [I<\\,-u|--utc|--universal\\/>] [I<\\,MMDDhhmm\\/>[[I<\\,CC\\/>]I<\\,"
"YY\\/>][I<\\,.ss\\/>]]"
msgstr ""
"B<date> [I<\\,-u|--utc|--universal\\/>] [I<\\,MMDDhhmm\\/>[[I<\\,CC\\/>]I<\\,"
"YY\\/>][I<\\,.ss\\/>]]"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "설명"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Display date and time in the given FORMAT.  With B<-s>, or with "
"[MMDDhhmm[[CC]YY][.ss]], set the date and time."
msgstr ""
"주어진 I<형식>으로 현재 날짜 및 시각을 표시합니다. B<-s> 옵션을 사용하거나 "
"[MMDDhhmm[[CC]YY][.ss]] 형식을 사용합니다. date와 time을 참고하십시오."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Mandatory arguments to long options are mandatory for short options too."
msgstr "긴 옵션의 필수 인자값은 짧은 옵션에서도 마찬가지입니다."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-d>, B<--date>=I<\\,STRING\\/>"
msgstr "B<-d>, B<--date>=I<\\,문자열\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "display time described by STRING, not 'now'"
msgstr "'now'가 아닌 I<문자열>로 설명한 시각을 표시합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--debug>"
msgstr "B<--debug>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "annotate the parsed date, and warn about questionable usage to stderr"
msgstr ""
"해석 날짜를 표기하며, 질문 가능한 사용법을 표준 오류에 경고로 내보냅니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-f>, B<--file>=I<\\,DATEFILE\\/>"
msgstr "B<-f>, B<--file>=I<\\,날짜파일\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like B<--date>; once for each line of DATEFILE"
msgstr "B<--date>와 유사하나, I<날짜파일>의 각 행당 한번씩 처리합니다."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-I[FMT]>, B<--iso-8601>[=I<\\,FMT\\/>]"
msgstr "B<-I[형식]>, B<--iso-8601>[=I<\\,형식\\/>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"output date/time in ISO 8601 format.  FMT='date' for date only (the "
"default), \\&'hours', 'minutes', 'seconds', or 'ns' for date and time to the "
"indicated precision.  Example: 2006-08-14T02:34:56-06:00"
msgstr ""
"ISO 8601 형식으로 일시를 출력합니다. I<형식>='date' 값은 날짜만 출력합니다 "
"(기본값). 'hours', 'minutes', 'seconds', 'ns'로 지시 단위의 정밀도에 따라 날"
"짜와 시각을 나타냅니다. 예: 2006-08-14T02:34:56-06:00"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--resolution>"
msgstr "B<--resolution>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output the available resolution of timestamps Example: 0.000000001"
msgstr "가용 정밀도로 타임스탬프를 출력합니다. 예제: 0.000000001"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-R>, B<--rfc-email>"
msgstr "B<-R>, B<--rfc-email>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"output date and time in RFC 5322 format.  Example: Mon, 14 Aug 2006 02:34:56 "
"B<-0600>"
msgstr ""
"RFC 5322 형식으로 날짜와 시각을 출력합니다. 예: 2006년 8월 14일 (월) "
"17:34:56 B<+0900>"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--rfc-3339>=I<\\,FMT\\/>"
msgstr "B<--rfc-3339>=I<\\,형식\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"output date/time in RFC 3339 format.  FMT='date', 'seconds', or 'ns' for "
"date and time to the indicated precision.  Example: 2006-08-14 02:34:56-06:00"
msgstr ""
"RFC 3339 형식으로 날짜/시각을 출력합니다. I<형식>='date', 'seconds', 'ns'로 "
"지시하는 정밀도에 따라 날짜와 시각을 출력합니다. 예제: 2006-08-14 "
"02:34:56-06:00"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-r>, B<--reference>=I<\\,FILE\\/>"
msgstr "B<-r>, B<--reference>=I<\\,파일\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "display the last modification time of FILE"
msgstr "I<파일>의 최근 수정 시각을 나타냅니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-s>, B<--set>=I<\\,STRING\\/>"
msgstr "B<-s>, B<--set>=I<\\,문자열\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "set time described by STRING"
msgstr "I<문자열> 에 따라 시간을 설정합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-u>, B<--utc>, B<--universal>"
msgstr "B<-u>, B<--utc>, B<--universal>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "print or set Coordinated Universal Time (UTC)"
msgstr "협정 세계표준시(UTC)에 맞춰 출력하거나 설정합니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--help>"
msgstr "B<--help>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "display this help and exit"
msgstr "이 도움말을 표시하고 나갑니다"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--version>"
msgstr "B<--version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output version information and exit"
msgstr "버전 정보를 출력하고 나갑니다"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"All options that specify the date to display are mutually exclusive.  I.e.: "
"B<--date>, B<--file>, B<--reference>, B<--resolution>."
msgstr ""
"표시할 날짜를 지정하는 모든 옵션은 혼용할 수 없습니다. 예: B<--date>, B<--"
"file>, B<--reference>, B<--resolution>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "FORMAT controls the output.  Interpreted sequences are:"
msgstr "I<형식>은 출력 방식을 설정합니다.  변환 시퀀스는 다음과 같습니다:"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%%"
msgstr "%%"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "a literal %"
msgstr "% 문자 그 자체"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%a"
msgstr "%a"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's abbreviated weekday name (e.g., Sun)"
msgstr "해당 로캘의 요일 줄임 이름(예: 일)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%A"
msgstr "%A"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's full weekday name (e.g., Sunday)"
msgstr "해당 로캘의 요일 전체 이름 (예: 일요일)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%b"
msgstr "%b"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's abbreviated month name (e.g., Jan)"
msgstr "해당 로캘의 월 줄임 이름 (e.g., 1월, Jan)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%B"
msgstr "%B"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's full month name (e.g., January)"
msgstr "해당 로캘의 월 전체 이름 (e.g., 1월, January)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%c"
msgstr "%c"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's date and time (e.g., Thu Mar 3 23:05:25 2005)"
msgstr "해당 로캘의 일시 (예: 2005. 05. 03. (목) 23:05:25)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%C"
msgstr "%C"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "century; like %Y, except omit last two digits (e.g., 20)"
msgstr "%Y와 유사한 세기, 아래 두자리는 제외함 (예: 20)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%d"
msgstr "%d"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "day of month (e.g., 01)"
msgstr "한달의 날짜 (예: 01)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%D"
msgstr "%D"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "date; same as %m/%d/%y"
msgstr "날짜 %m/%d/%y와 동일"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%e"
msgstr "%e"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "day of month, space padded; same as %_d"
msgstr "한달의 날짜, 공백 자릿수 맞춤. %_d와 동일"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%F"
msgstr "%F"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "full date; like %+4Y-%m-%d"
msgstr "전체 날짜. %+4Y-%m-%d와 동일"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%g"
msgstr "%g"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "last two digits of year of ISO week number (see %G)"
msgstr "ISO 주 번호의 연도 아래 두 자릿수 (%G 참조)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%G"
msgstr "%G"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "year of ISO week number (see %V); normally useful only with %V"
msgstr "ISO 주 번호의 연도 (%V 참조). 보통 %V와 사용함"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%h"
msgstr "%h"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "same as %b"
msgstr "%b 와 동일"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%H"
msgstr "%H"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "hour (00..23)"
msgstr "시 (00..23)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%I"
msgstr "%I"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "hour (01..12)"
msgstr "시 (01..12)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%j"
msgstr "%j"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "day of year (001..366)"
msgstr "연 중 일 (001..366)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%k"
msgstr "%k"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "hour, space padded ( 0..23); same as %_H"
msgstr "24시간제 시간, 공백 자릿수 맞춤 ( 0..23). %_H와 동일"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%l"
msgstr "%l"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "hour, space padded ( 1..12); same as %_I"
msgstr "12시간제 시간, 공백 자릿수 맞춤 ( 1..12). %_I와 동일"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%m"
msgstr "%m"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "month (01..12)"
msgstr "월 (01..12)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%M"
msgstr "%M"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "minute (00..59)"
msgstr "분 (00..59)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%n"
msgstr "%n"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "a newline"
msgstr "줄바꿈"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%N"
msgstr "%N"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "nanoseconds (000000000..999999999)"
msgstr "나노초 (000000000..999999999)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%p"
msgstr "%p"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's equivalent of either AM or PM; blank if not known"
msgstr "AM, PM에 해당하는 로캘의 표기. 알 수 없을 경우 공백"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%P"
msgstr "%P"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "like %p, but lower case"
msgstr "%p와 유사하나, 소문자"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%q"
msgstr "%q"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "quarter of year (1..4)"
msgstr "4분위 분기 (1..4)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%r"
msgstr "%r"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's 12-hour clock time (e.g., 11:11:04 PM)"
msgstr "로캘의 12시간제 시계 (예: 오후 11:11:04)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%R"
msgstr "%R"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "24-hour hour and minute; same as %H:%M"
msgstr "24시간제 시간, 분. %H:%M과 동일"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%s"
msgstr "%s"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "seconds since the Epoch (1970-01-01 00:00 UTC)"
msgstr "1970-01-01 00:00:00 UTC 부터의 에포크 날짜 기준 초"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%S"
msgstr "%S"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "second (00..60)"
msgstr "초 (00..60)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%t"
msgstr "%t"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "a tab"
msgstr "탭"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%T"
msgstr "%T"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "time; same as %H:%M:%S"
msgstr "시각. %H:%M:%S와 동일"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%u"
msgstr "%u"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "day of week (1..7); 1 is Monday"
msgstr "요일 (1..7). 1은 월요일"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%U"
msgstr "%U"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "week number of year, with Sunday as first day of week (00..53)"
msgstr "연 중 주 번호, 일요일을 주의 첫번째 날로 생각 (00..53)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%V"
msgstr "%V"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "ISO week number, with Monday as first day of week (01..53)"
msgstr "ISO 주차 번호, 월요일이 한주의 첫날일 경우 (01..53)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%w"
msgstr "%w"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "day of week (0..6); 0 is Sunday"
msgstr "요일 (0..6). 0은 일요일"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%W"
msgstr "%W"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "week number of year, with Monday as first day of week (00..53)"
msgstr "연 중 주 번호, 월요일을 주의 첫번째 날로 생각 (00..53)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%x"
msgstr "%x"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's date representation (e.g., 12/31/99)"
msgstr "로캘의 날짜 표현 (예: 12/31/99)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%X"
msgstr "%X"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "locale's time representation (e.g., 23:13:48)"
msgstr "로캘의 시각 표현 (예: 23:13:48)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%y"
msgstr "%y"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "last two digits of year (00..99)"
msgstr "연 중 일의 마지막 두 숫자 (00..99)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%Y"
msgstr "%Y"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "year"
msgstr "연도"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%z"
msgstr "%z"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "+hhmm numeric time zone (e.g., B<-0400>)"
msgstr "+hhmm 숫자 지정 시간대 (e.g., -0400)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%:z"
msgstr "%:z"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "+hh:mm numeric time zone (e.g., B<-04>:00)"
msgstr "+hh:mm 숫자 지정 시간대 (e.g., -04:00)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%::z"
msgstr "%::z"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "+hh:mm:ss numeric time zone (e.g., B<-04>:00:00)"
msgstr "+hh:mm:ss 숫자 지정 시간대 (e.g., -04:00:00)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%:::z"
msgstr "%:::z"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "numeric time zone with : to necessary precision (e.g., B<-04>, +05:30)"
msgstr "시간대 정밀도 표현에 : 이 필요한 숫자 지정 시간대 (e.g., -04, +05:30)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "%Z"
msgstr "%Z"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "alphabetic time zone abbreviation (e.g., EDT)"
msgstr "시간대 알파벳 약자 (예: EDT)"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"By default, date pads numeric fields with zeroes.  The following optional "
"flags may follow '%':"
msgstr ""
"기본적으로, 날짜의 숫자 부분은 0으로 자릿수를 채워 맞춥니다. '%' 기호 다음 추"
"가 플래그가 따라 붙을 수 있습니다:"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "-"
msgstr "-"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "(hyphen) do not pad the field"
msgstr "(하이픈) 필드를 채우지 않는다."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "_"
msgstr "_"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "(underscore) pad with spaces"
msgstr "(밑줄) 공백으로 자릿수 맞춤"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "(zero) pad with zeros"
msgstr "(영) 0으로 자릿수 맞춤"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "+"
msgstr "+"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "pad with zeros, and put '+' before future years with E<gt>4 digits"
msgstr "0으로 자릿수 맞추고, 4자릿수 넘을 때 미래 연도 앞에 '+'붙임"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "^"
msgstr "^"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "use upper case if possible"
msgstr "가능한 경우 대문자 사용"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "#"
msgstr "#"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "use opposite case if possible"
msgstr "가능한 경우 케이스를 반대(대 ↔ 소)로"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"After any flags comes an optional field width, as a decimal number; then an "
"optional modifier, which is either E to use the locale's alternate "
"representations if available, or O to use the locale's alternate numeric "
"symbols if available."
msgstr ""
"추가 필드 너비 값이 10진수로 오고 나면 다음 둘 중 하나의 추가 수정자를 활용"
"할 수 있습니다 E는 가용 상태일 때 로캘 대체 표현을 사용합니다. O는 가용 상태"
"일 때 대체 숫자 심볼을 사용합니다."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "EXAMPLES"
msgstr "폐제"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Convert seconds since the Epoch (1970-01-01 UTC) to a date"
msgstr "에포크 날짜(1970-01-01 UTC)로부터 현재 일시까지 초 단위로 변환"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "CW<$ date --date='@2147483647'>"
msgstr "CW<$ date --date='@2147483647'>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Show the time on the west coast of the US (use B<tzselect>(1) to find TZ)"
msgstr "대한민국 서울 기준 시각 표시 (TZ 값은 B<tzselect>(1) 명령을 활용)"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "CW<$ TZ='America/Los_Angeles' date>"
msgstr "CW<$ TZ='Asia/Seoul' date>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Show the local time for 9AM next Friday on the west coast of the US"
msgstr "대한민국 서울 기준 다음주 금요일 오전 9시 지역 시각 표시"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "CW<$ date --date='TZ=\"America/Los_Angeles\" 09:00 next Fri'>"
msgstr "CW<$ date --date='TZ=\"Asia/Seoul\" 09:00 next Fri'>"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DATE STRING"
msgstr ""

#.  NOTE: keep this paragraph in sync with the one in touch.x
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The --date=STRING is a mostly free format human readable date string such as "
"\"Sun, 29 Feb 2004 16:21:42 -0800\" or \"2004-02-29 16:21:42\" or even "
"\"next Thursday\".  A date string may contain items indicating calendar "
"date, time of day, time zone, day of week, relative time, relative date, and "
"numbers.  An empty string indicates the beginning of the day.  The date "
"string format is more complex than is easily documented here but is fully "
"described in the info documentation."
msgstr ""

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
